   "html": "The book prints $+\\frac{i\\kgamma}{2}\\hat{c}^\\dagger\\hat{c}$. Eq. (6.7) gives the non-Hermitian part with a minus sign, and with $\\hbar = 1$ only the minus sign makes the amplitude of $|2\\rangle$ decay as Eqs. (6.25) and (6.26) say: $\\kHeff = \\kDelta|2\\rangle\\langle 2| - \\frac{i\\kgamma}{2}\\hat{c}^\\dagger\\hat{c}$."
